        iso:hasPracticeDescription "Identify the specific Tasks to be performed in order to produce the Deliverables and their Software Components identified in the Statement of Work. Include Tasks in the SI process along with verification, validation, and reviews with Customer and Work Team Tasks to ensure the quality of work products. Identify the Tasks to perform the Delivery Instructions. Document the Tasks." ;
