        iso:hasWorkProductCharacteristicID "WPC.15" ;
        iso:hasWorkProductCharacteristicList """# Architectural or high-level software design
- Describes the overall software structure:
- Identifies the required software components
- Identifies the relationship between software components
- Consideration is given to any required:
