        iso:hasTaskDescription """Document the software design:
- Analyse the Requirement specification to generate the architectural design/ to define the software components/ the internal and external interfaces.
- Describe in detail/ the appearance and the behaviour of the interface/ based on the Requirement specification/ in a way that resources for its implementation can be planned.
- Provide the detail of software components and their interfaces to allow their construction.
- Update the traceability record to include the software design.""" ;
        iso:hasTaskID "SI.3.3" ;
        iso:hasTaskNote "NOTE: The AN helps the DES to understand the requirements." ;
        iso:isTaskOf iso:SI.ACT.03 .

