        iso:hasTaskDescription """Verify and obtain approval of the software Requirement specification from the AN:
- Make corrections until the document is approved by AN.
- Verify the correctness and testability of the software Requirement specification and its consistency with the product description.
- Review to check that requirements are complete/ unambiguous and not contradictory. 
- Conditional task: Initiate a change request if significant changes (those affecting project delivery schedule/ project costs/ etc.) were needed.""" ;
        iso:hasTaskID "SI.2.3" ;
        iso:hasTaskNote "NOTE 1: The results of the verification are documented in the verification record.",
            "NOTE 2: ISO/IEC 20246 defines different types of work product reviews." ;
        iso:isTaskOf iso:SI.ACT.02 .

