            iso:SI.OWP.03.04.WP21,
            iso:SI.OWP.03.04.WP23 ;
        iso:hasRole iso:SI.ROLE.06,
            iso:SI.ROLE.07 ;
        iso:hasTaskDescription """Verify and obtain approval of the software design from DES:
- Verify correctness of software design documentation/ its feasibility and consistency with their requirement specification.
- Verify that the traceability record contains the adequate relationships between requirements and the software design elements.
- Make corrections are until the document is approved by DES.""" ;
        iso:hasTaskID "SI.3.4" ;
        iso:hasTaskNote "NOTE 1: The results of the verification are documented in the verification record.",
            "NOTE 2: Conditional task: If significant changes were needed/ initiate a change request.",
            "NOTE 3: The AN helps the DES to assure that the design meets the requirements." ;
        iso:isTaskOf iso:SI.ACT.03 .

